  "description": "Ramani Dalbehera, a Lanjia Sora speaker from Rayagada district, Odisha, India, talks about her experience of Aadhaar, India's biometric ID. Opino Gomango and Subhashish Panigrahi interviewed her in 2019 for Panigrahi's 2021 documentary MarginalizedAadhaar. Gomango asked the questions in Sora, building on Panigrahi's broader questions in Odia, with Namad Dalbehera, a Lanjia Sora speaker related to Ramani, present. Panigrahi edited unused or trimmed footage from the film and published it under the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2026. English subtitles are by Gomango, and the edits and Odia subtitles are by Panigrahi.",
